@pgxsinkit/pgwasm-c
===================

This package republishes compiled third-party software and includes host code that
began as a copy of third-party code. These attributions are permanent.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ElectricSQL — @electric-sql/pglite (host code under `src/`)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The C build's host code under `src/` (module instantiation, initdb, the memory,
IndexedDB and file mounts, the filesystem adapter, extension install) began as a copy
of ElectricSQL's PGlite (`packages/pglite`, `packages/pglite-utils`):

  Source:  https://github.com/electric-sql/pglite
  License: PostgreSQL License (PGlite is dual-licensed Apache-2.0 / PostgreSQL
           License; pgxsinkit takes it under the PostgreSQL License)
  Copyright (c) ElectricSQL and contributors

Owned outright (ADR-0062); compatibility with PGlite is an explicit anti-goal. The
PostgreSQL License text is in LICENSE.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Components compiled into the artefacts (`artefacts/pglite.wasm`, `pglite.data`,
`pglite.js`, `initdb.wasm`, `initdb.js`, `amcheck.tar.gz`)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The artefacts are republished byte-identical from `@electric-sql/pglite` 0.5.8
(https://registry.npmjs.org/@electric-sql/pglite/-/pglite-0.5.8.tgz; sha256 of every
file pinned in `src/artefact-pins.ts`). They were built from ElectricSQL's
`postgres-pglite` tree with Emscripten, and contain:

  - PostgreSQL 18 (PostgreSQL License, (c) PostgreSQL Global Development Group and
    The Regents of the University of California) — https://www.postgresql.org
  - ElectricSQL's changes to PostgreSQL for PGlite (PostgreSQL License,
    (c) ElectricSQL and contributors) — https://github.com/electric-sql/postgres-pglite
  - ICU and its data files (Unicode License v3, (c) Unicode, Inc.); the full licence
    text travels inside `pglite.data` at `/pglite/icu/LICENSE`
  - libxml2 (MIT, (c) Daniel Veillard and contributors)
  - libxslt (MIT, (c) Daniel Veillard and contributors)
  - zlib (zlib License, (c) Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler)
  - OSSP uuid (MIT-style licence, (c) Ralf S. Engelschall and The OSSP Project)
  - the Emscripten runtime in the generated JavaScript glue (`pglite.js`,
    `initdb.js`) and its system libraries (MIT / University of Illinois NCSA,
    (c) the Emscripten authors), including musl libc (MIT, (c) Rich Felker and
    contributors) and LLVM compiler-rt (Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions)

The list is derived from the configure line embedded in `pglite.wasm`
(`--with-icu --with-uuid=ossp --with-zlib --with-libxml --with-libxslt`) and from the
Emscripten toolchain that produced it.
